@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : if valid then Save User Details and Allow Login else End Process

state Login
Login : entry / Get the Login Details
Login : if correct then Proceed else Provide Multiple Attempts

state Citizen
Citizen : entry / Logged In
Citizen : can Upload Documents, View Profile, Apply for Certificate
Citizen : can Continue Uploading Documents if needed
Citizen --> Session : [Logout] : Done with Actions

state Registrar
Registrar : entry / Logged In
Registrar : can Request Certificates for Verification
Registrar : can Request Multiple Certificates and Continue Requesting more after receiving one
Registrar --> Session : [Logout] : Done with Actions

state Session
Session : entry / User Actions
Session : end when DONE_WITH_ACTIONS : COMPLETION_EVENT

@enduml
